It´s already over? Did I really make it? Was it really that easy.

After 2 years of playing, I made it. Few months ago I completed the
quest first time. That was chaotic human priestess, and she died in
Gehennom. Then I feeled that I could ascend someday, but I never
thought I would ascend Archeologist first. I have still major problems
with non-fighter class. But I did, and she did not die even once.

I didn´t take any notes. I thought she would die before level 8 as
usual. I don´t even remember was she male or female at the beginning,
she changed sex couple of times. (I think she was female.)

In level 2 she found a armor shop. [HoTelepathy! That sure was helpful
in early. For some reason she did sokoban first. (Normally I go into
GM as early as I can) "AoReflection. She killed pet dog by accident in
first level of soko. I thought that ray of fire would stop before her
pet. She found /WoP somewhere then id and bought =RoPC.

Into the gnomish mines. There was nasty leocrotta, who almost killed
her, but she was able to escape. Then she polymorphed into Vampire
Lord and went to kick some leocrotta´s ass (my first controlled
polymorph). Rest of mines was quite easy. She found a magic whistle
and a luckstone, and started to climb up. Then in gnome town she
decide to have fun. She polymorphed into Vampire lord again, killed a
delicatessen keeper, bought protection and killed some watchmen (and
another pet dog, while confused :( ). Then a watch captain came to
show his friend, a silver saber. Two hits hits and she has only 3 HPs
left. !PoEH. A captain was killed after next hit. That was close. Then
she converted the altar and killed the priest. And lost protection.
Some sacrificing and she got Vorpal Blade. Heads rolled.

She continued in main dungeon. Nothing special until lvl 22, where she
found bones of my barbarian. [GDSM! She turned Medusa into the stone
and went to the castle. She wished for blessed rustproof +3 [GoP and
blessed +3 greased rustproof [HoB. She had already found [SB, [CoP and
Hawaiian shirt. Then she went to quest.

She didn´t take quest earlier because I didn´t know how hard it is.
Well, it was my easiest quest ever. The Minion of Huhetotl was such a
wimp. I was REALLY offended when he died after 4 hits. NO! That can´t
be that easy!!! I almost threw my computer out of window. I would have
understand if he had lost his head, but NO! I wanted to have a good
fight.

Then she went to the castle, wished for seven candles (there was only
three in Gnome town, she did found later 4 candles in Gehennom), magic
markers and enchanted and fooproofed my staff. AC -45 (naked AC 2) and
+6 Vorpy. Not bad. Maybe she will make it, I thought. Then she went
into Gehennom.

Boring, boring, boring...
Most of Demon pinces lost their heads. She had some troubles finding
Vlad´s tower. Vlad the Headless was just a piece of cake. Then she
found vibrating square, and went to kick Rodney. He was a bit
trickier. She hit Rodney couple of times, but Rod didn´t want to lose
his head. She got bored and zapped him with /WoDeath.

Another wand of wishing. What I´m supposed to do with that? I don´t
need any wishes anymore. Stupid game!

My first invocation ever: First candles, then book... Oops! Some
friend came around. That´s nice.

High priest got some /WoDeath. "AoY! Is it real?

Then she climbed up. At first it was quite exciting, but...

