cursed ?SoGD) and went to the elementary planes.

Earth: Next time I´ll take more wands of digging with me. I used most
of them in Gehennom. Easy.
Air: Easiest of four. Air elementals are nasty /WoT is your friend.
Fire: Hardest, but with =RoC and /WoCold she made it. Quite easy after
all.
Water: I had to wish for cursed ?SoGD. Easy.

Astral plane: Death in left, Famine in Center and Pestilence in Right.
I got Guardian Angel, but she died later. I had no idea who is bad and
who isn´t. She took Death first. She zapped Death with wand of death.
Not very good idea, I guess. I fighted all the way to the altar. Some
lower level monsters kept Death away. On the way to the altar She
accidently picked up stuff including fake "AoY (good thing I #named
the real one) and got burdened. She dropped those and continued to the
altar. Again, she picked up stuff. Then I accidently dropped "AoY (the
REAL one) with other stuff.

Chaotic. Then she took pestilence. /WoDeath. On the way to the altar,
she decided to check once more if her "AoY is really real one.
